OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with murder after 
OL,4,A'street assault'                       
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder  
OL,7,Fafter a man died following an alleged  
OL,8,Fstreet assault in June.                
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said the charges  
OL,11,Fwere in connection with the death of   
OL,12,FNathan Jordan, 33, in Chesham,         
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, on 10 June.           
OL,15,FThe men charged are Leighlan Johnson,  
OL,16,F19, and Shane Johnson, 47, both from   
OL,17,FNorthampton. They were arrested earlier
OL,18,Fin the year and rearrested on Thursday,
OL,19,Fthe force said.                        
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
