OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with murder after 
OL,4,A'street assault'                       
OL,6,FLeighlan Johnson has also been charged 
OL,7,Fwith failing to disclose the key to    
OL,8,Fprotected information when lawfully    
OL,9,Frequired to do so. Shane Johnson has   
OL,10,Falso been charged with two counts of   
OL,11,Fpossession with intent to supply a     
OL,12,Fcontrolled Class B drug.               
